---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="匿名建議｜PickleStart Taiwan"
  description="如果你對 PickleStart 有任何建議、看不懂的地方，或希望我們改進的內容，歡迎匿名告訴我們。"
>
  <article class="feedback-page">
    <header class="feedback-hero">
      <p class="feedback-eyebrow">FEEDBACK</p>
      <h1>有沒有什麼想對<br />PickleStart 說的？</h1>
      <p class="feedback-lead">
        不用留下姓名或 Email。哪裡不好用、看不懂，
        或有任何希望我們改進的地方，都歡迎直接告訴我們。
      </p>
    </header>

    <section class="feedback-meta-grid" aria-label="回饋表單說明">
      <article class="feedback-meta-card">
        <span>01</span>
        <strong>匿名填寫</strong>
        <p>不用留下姓名或 Email，直接寫下你的想法就好。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feedback-meta-card">
        <span>02</span>
        <strong>只要 1 題</strong>
        <p>不用分類、不用評分，想到什麼就直接告訴我們。</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feedback-meta-card">
        <span>03</span>
        <strong>幫助我們改進</strong>
        <p>看不懂、不好用或希望增加的內容，都很有參考價值。</p>
      </article>
    </section>

    <section class="feedback-form-shell">
      <div class="feedback-form-heading">
        <div>
          <p class="feedback-kicker">ANONYMOUS FORM</p>
          <h2>匿名建議表單</h2>
          <p>
            如果你只想快速留一句話，也完全沒問題。
          </p>
        </div>

        <span class="feedback-badge">1 題就好</span>
      </div>

      <div class="feedback-embed-frame">
        <iframe
          src="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScHn3RlAWr91-Mt4T3UnhsuWCZRyyUuQdjfAoyW7jq9tGZC3g/viewform?embedded=true"
          title="PickleStart Taiwan 匿名建議表單"
          width="100%"
          height="560"
          frameborder="0"
          marginheight="0"
          marginwidth="0"
          loading="lazy"
        >
          載入中…
        </iframe>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="feedback-callout">
      <div class="feedback-callout-copy">
        <p class="feedback-kicker">WHY WE ASK</p>
        <h2>你的回饋，會幫我們把網站做得更清楚</h2>
        <p>
          你遇到的困惑、卡住的地方，很可能也是下一位新手會遇到的問題。
          我們會把這些回饋當成後續調整內容與功能的重要參考。
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="feedback-callout-list">
        <div>
          <span>01</span>
          <p>哪裡看不懂</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>02</span>
          <p>哪裡不好用</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <span>03</span>
          <p>希望我們增加什麼</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <p class="feedback-note">
      表單由 Google Forms 提供。請不要在建議中填寫密碼、付款資訊或其他敏感個人資料。
    </p>
  </article>

  <style>
    .feedback-page {
      --feedback-navy: #10243f;
      --feedback-blue: #087fa5;
      --feedback-lime: #e2f52c;
      --feedback-muted: #6f8090;
      --feedback-line: #dfe7ea;
      --feedback-surface: #f7faf9;

      width: min(1080px, calc(100% - 40px));
      margin: 0 auto;
      padding: 58px 0 92px;
      color: var(--feedback-muted);
    }

    .feedback-hero {
      max-width: 780px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .feedback-eyebrow,
    .feedback-kicker {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      color: var(--feedback-blue);
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    }

    .feedback-hero h1 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--feedback-navy);
      font-size: clamp(2.65rem, 5.7vw, 4.8rem);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -0.045em;
    }

    .feedback-lead {
      max-width: 650px;
      margin: 22px auto 0;
      font-size: 1.04rem;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .feedback-meta-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 16px;
      margin: 38px 0 24px;
    }

    .feedback-meta-card {
      min-height: 152px;
      padding: 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--feedback-line);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .feedback-meta-card > span {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      color: var(--feedback-blue);
      font-size: 0.76rem;
      font-weight: 900;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    .feedback-meta-card strong {
      display: block;
      color: var(--feedback-navy);
      font-size: 1.04rem;
    }

    .feedback-meta-card p {
      margin: 8px 0 0;
      line-height: 1.65;
    }

    .feedback-form-shell {
      margin-top: 22px;
      padding: 26px;
      border: 1px solid var(--feedback-line);
      border-radius: 26px;
      background: linear-gradient(155deg, #f8fbfc 0%, #ffffff 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 20px 48px rgba(16, 36, 63, 0.07);
    }

    .feedback-form-heading {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .feedback-form-heading h2,
    .feedback-callout h2 {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--feedback-navy);
      font-size: clamp(1.7rem, 3vw, 2.45rem);
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    }

    .feedback-form-heading p:last-child {
      margin: 10px 0 0;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    .feedback-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 34px;
      padding: 7px 13px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--feedback-lime);
      color: var(--feedback-navy);
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      font-weight: 850;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .feedback-embed-frame {
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--feedback-line);
      border-radius: 20px;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .feedback-embed-frame iframe {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      border: 0;
      background: #fff;
    }

    .feedback-callout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(300px, 0.8fr);
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: stretch;
      margin-top: 42px;
      padding: 32px;
      border-radius: 26px;
      background: var(--feedback-navy);
      color: #dce5ec;
    }

    .feedback-callout .feedback-kicker {
      color: #9ddbed;
    }

    .feedback-callout h2 {
      color: #fff;
    }

    .feedback-callout-copy > p:last-child {
      margin: 16px 0 0;
      line-height: 1.8;
    }

    .feedback-callout-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .feedback-callout-list div {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 38px 1fr;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      min-height: 54px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    }

    .feedback-callout-list span {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      border-radius: 9px;
      background: var(--feedback-lime);
      color: var(--feedback-navy);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 900;
    }

    .feedback-callout-list p {
      margin: 0;
      color: #fff;
      font-weight: 750;
    }

    .feedback-note {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 18px auto 0;
      color: #84919d;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .feedback-meta-grid,
      .feedback-callout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .feedback-meta-card {
        min-height: auto;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .feedback-page {
        width: min(100% - 28px, 1080px);
        padding: 40px 0 70px;
      }

      .feedback-hero h1 {
        font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 11vw, 3.3rem);
      }

      .feedback-form-shell,
      .feedback-callout {
        padding: 20px;
        border-radius: 20px;
      }

      .feedback-form-heading {
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 12px;
      }

      .feedback-embed-frame {
        border-radius: 14px;
      }

      .feedback-embed-frame iframe {
        height: 610px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</BaseLayout>
